{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in the Third, a mysterious world filled with dozens of unique enemies and environments. Explore the first two of these sprawling regions in this demo, using only a slingshot to fight your way to victory. And be careful, for a single hit can kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/33274ef8ba2aa7eddcfc38a3aa05bc6d.poster.avif?t=1752758670\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/33274ef8ba2aa7eddcfc38a3aa05bc6d.webm?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/33274ef8ba2aa7eddcfc38a3aa05bc6d.mp4?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILL BASED PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no powerups or leveling systems. Progression is tied solely to your skill as a player. And in a world where most enemies die in a single hit, this means constantly adapting to new attack and movement patterns. From flying piranhas to crystalline machines, each enemy offers a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/32df211423df2dc51274d760fcf03ffc.poster.avif?t=1752758670\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/32df211423df2dc51274d760fcf03ffc.webm?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/32df211423df2dc51274d760fcf03ffc.mp4?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BATTLE SINGULARITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enormous machines with ever shifting weak points and methods of attack. Each machine felled unlocks a new region to explore and new enemies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.poster.avif?t=1752758670\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.webm?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.mp4?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you play, the more the world will change. Where do the limits of this game truly lie?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/be6f5f25119f48ddb39898f8e2dbdbaa.poster.avif?t=1752758670\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/extras/be6f5f25119f48ddb39898f8e2dbdbaa.webm?t=1752758670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875800?t=1752758670","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875800/20ddd0adcb40b0133fcdee1b691697e23766d549/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752758670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste